[I] Conntrack can view and manage the in-kernel connections

[T] Using conntrack, you can view and manage the in-kernel connection tracking
[T] state table from userspace. On the other hand, conntrackd covers the
[T] specific aspects of stateful firewalls to enable highly available
[T] scenarios, and can be used as statistics collector as well.

[U] https://www.netfilter.org/projects/conntrack-tools/index.html

